tn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682320/extras/1a6663dfea14525c78c92db34d2fad43.poster.avif?t=1728890123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682320/extras/1a6663dfea14525c78c92db34d2fad43.webm?t=1728890123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682320/extras/1a6663dfea14525c78c92db34d2fad43.mp4?t=1728890123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Find parts of exclusive cars, motorbikes, rebuild them and then sell for a big payout.</strong> <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682320/extras/eeb8d133cc6ac548fbc878e5f7c2da6a.poster.avif?t=1728890123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682320/extras/eeb8d133cc6ac548fbc878e5f7c2da6a.webm?t=1728890123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1682320/extras/eeb8d133cc6ac548fbc878e5f7c2da6a.mp4?t=1728890123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Discover crazy stories of the locations you visit and items you collect.</strong> </p></li></ul>",
